      "evidence": "Enabled-mode Snapshot owns an additional collector Arc, separate from base Counters. Fixed 65536-cycle measurement implies 65536 clone/drop pairs. Existing binary retains conditional lock incq at 0x864de and corresponding Snapshot drop lock decq at 0x70bd2. This is source/static-binary derivation, not a hardware count of that site.",
