      "batching_path": "fs/jbd2/transaction.c:1903-1925: max_batch_time sleep is conditional on handle->h_sync, a different j_last_sync_writer PID, a nonzero cap and transaction age below bounded average commit time. It is not an unconditional sleep on every ordinary fsync.",
      "interpretation": "The retained worker wakes are consistent with journal-completion waiting. The 5ms-class intervals end in waking from PID470, while PID0-context intervals are tens of microseconds. Current settings plus this source/trace evidence do not justify max_batch_time=0 as a fix.",
